    "created_at": "2018-02-02T17:32:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-02T17:32:26Z",
    "body": "The concept does not intend to introduce a new language to the web. The concept is based on allowing execution of existing binaries already available at the user OS, and wrapping `stdout` as a JavaScript module which can be imported as a JavaScript module. The execution of the binary would occur at the OS level. Perhaps utilizing [`WebAssembly`](https://github.com/WebAssembly/) [Language virtual machines #535](https://github.com/WebAssembly/design/issues/535) or other means internally to achieve the requirement.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
