    "created_at": "2018-02-02T17:38:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-02T17:38:05Z",
    "body": "The user could configure the sandboxed environment for the specific commands which are authorized, for example excluding `rm`; though the language used at the OS could be any binary, PHP, python, C++, etc. We would not allow, for example, external resources to be requested.\r\n\r\nWe can already do this using Native Messaging. The concept is to allow the same procedure at `<script type=\"shell\">` element. \r\n\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
